{"tuid":"0f4x5i2elojxez6l","pageVersion":4,"fetchedAt":"2026-09-30T09:55:56.751Z","record":{"colophon":{"generator":"ifdb.org/viewgame","generatorversion":1,"originated":"2008-06-20"},"identification":{"ifids":["ZCODE-6-060304-E496"],"bafn":2244,"format":"zcode"},"bibliographic":{"title":"The Act of Misdirection","author":"Callico Harrison","language":"en","firstpublished":"2004","genre":"Fantasy/Historical/Horror","description":"The curtain lifts to a torrent of applause, as the city&#039;s gents and ladies lose their decorum for a just few moments in anticipation of something magical. The spotlights drown the glitter of sequins and pearls, the metal cane-tops and the shining buttons on the waistcoats. From where you are, centre of the boards, behind nothing but a baize table with nothing but the clothes you stand in, you are quite alone in the blinding white light. <br> <br><em>The Act of Misdirection</em> is a short horror story about magic both fake and real, on the stage of Victorian England. It was nominated for a XYZZY for Best Story of 2004."},"contacts":[],"ifdb":{"tuid":"0f4x5i2elojxez6l","pageversion":4,"link":"https://ifdb.org/viewgame?id=0f4x5i2elojxez6l","coverart":{"url":"https://ifdb.org/coverart?id=0f4x5i2elojxez6l&version=4"},"primaryPlayOnlineUrl":"https://iplayif.com/?story=https%3A%2F%2Fifarchive.org%2Fif-archive%2Fgames%2Fzcode%2FMisdirection.z5","downloads":{"links":[{"url":"http://www.ifarchive.org/if-archive/games/zcode/Misdirection.z5","playOnlineUrl":"https://iplayif.com/?story=https%3A%2F%2Fifarchive.org%2Fif-archive%2Fgames%2Fzcode%2FMisdirection.z5","title":"Misdirection.z5","isGame":true,"format":"zcode"},{"url":"http://www.ifarchive.org/if-archive/games/zcode/Misdirection.txt","title":"Misdirection.txt","desc":"author's note","format":"text"}]},"averageRating":3.657534246,"starRating":3.5,"ratingCountAvg":73,"ratingCountTot":73,"tags":[{"name":"1800s","tagcnt":1,"gamecnt":32},{"name":"cover art","tagcnt":1,"gamecnt":1775},{"name":"fem